  "design": {
    "idea": "U-Turn Optical Wake Corridor: first Brass Receipt showcase! Stamp plate_r6_stamp with a thrown lantern (6s golden Receipt holds mover_wall open), hang lantern on hook_r6_dark, and sprint unlit through Shadow Gate sgate_r6 to latch both the North gate and Overworld Backdoor.",
